---
import { PHONE } from '../data/data.astro';
---

<footer class="bg-gray-900 py-12 text-white">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
		<div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-4">
			<div>
				<h3 class="mb-4 text-xl font-bold" style="font-family: Pacifico, serif;">
					Cerrajero Málaga 24h
				</h3><p class="mb-4 text-gray-400">
					Tu cerrajero de confianza en Málaga. Servicio profesional las 24 horas del día.
				</p>
				<!-- <div class="flex space-x-4">
          <i
            class="ri-facebook-circle-line text-2xl text-gray-400 hover:text-white cursor-pointer"
          ></i><i
            class="ri-instagram-line text-2xl text-gray-400 hover:text-white cursor-pointer"
          ></i><i
            class="ri-twitter-line text-2xl text-gray-400 hover:text-white cursor-pointer"
          ></i>
        </div> -->
			</div>
			<div>
				<h4 class="mb-4 text-lg font-semibold">Servicios</h4><ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-400">
					<li class="cursor-pointer hover:text-white">Apertura de puertas</li><li
						class="cursor-pointer hover:text-white"
					>
						Cambio de cerraduras
					</li><li class="cursor-pointer hover:text-white">Cerrajería del automóvil</li><li
						class="cursor-pointer hover:text-white"
					>
						Sistemas de seguridad
					</li><li class="cursor-pointer hover:text-white">Duplicado de llaves</li>
				</ul>
			</div><div>
				<h4 class="mb-4 text-lg font-semibold">Zonas</h4><ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-400">
					<li class="cursor-pointer hover:text-white">Málaga Centro</li><li
						class="cursor-pointer hover:text-white"
					>
						Marbella
					</li><li class="cursor-pointer hover:text-white">Fuengirola</li><li
						class="cursor-pointer hover:text-white"
					>
						Torremolinos
					</li><li class="cursor-pointer hover:text-white">Todas las zonas</li>
				</ul>
			</div><div>
				<h4 class="mb-4 text-lg font-semibold">Contacto</h4><div class="space-y-3 text-gray-400">
					<div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
						<i class="ri-phone-line"></i><span>{PHONE}</span>
					</div><div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
						<i class="ri-whatsapp-line"></i><span>+34 {PHONE}</span>
					</div><div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
						<i class="ri-map-pin-line"></i><span>Málaga, España</span>
					</div><div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
						<i class="ri-time-line"></i><span>24/7 Disponible</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div><div class="mt-8 border-t border-gray-800 pt-8 text-center text-gray-400">
			<p>© 2025 Cerrajero Málaga 24h. Todos los derechos reservados.</p><a
				href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jose-antonio-aguilar-granados/"
				target="_blank"
				class="link cursor-pointer hover:text-white" rel="noopener noreferrer">Creada por Jose Aguilar</a
			>
		</div>
	</div>

			<p style="font-size: 0.75rem; opacity: 0.7; margin: 0.5rem 0 0;">
				<small>Web creada por <a href="https://sur-digital.vercel.app/" rel="noopener">Sur Digital</a></small>
